# The programs skwir's macOS package carries (tools/package/macos.sh,
# ADR-075): skwir, the helpers that link no library the bundle would
# have to carry for them, and the archive helper, libarchive linked in
# statically (tools/package/libarchive.sh, ADR-041). Those that link
# another (Poppler, MuPDF, DjVuLibre, GStreamer) wait for their libraries;
# skwir says the engine is not installed. Their notices are
# tools/package/notices/macos.
skwir
skwir-pdf-worker
skwir-djvu-worker
skwir-model-worker
skwir-module-worker
skwir-archive-worker
